ction:\n\n$$\nf(x)=(\\genfrac{}{}{0pt}{}{n}{x}){p}^{x}(1-p)^{n-x}\n$$\n\nHere, we have $X∼B(7,0.9),$ so $X$ has the probability mass function\n\n$$\nf(x)=(\\genfrac{}{}{0pt}{}{7}{x})(0.9)^{x}(0.1)^{7-x}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(5\\le X\\le 6) & =P(X\\in {5,6}) \\\\  & =f(5)+f(6) \\\\  & =(\\genfrac{}{}{0pt}{}{7}{5})(0.9)^{5}(0.1)^{7-5}+(\\genfrac{}{}{0pt}{}{7}{6})(0.9)^{6}(0.1)^{7-6} \\\\  & =21(0.9)^{5}(0.1)^{2}+7(0.9)^{6}(0.1) \\\\  & ≈0.4960\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nto $4$ decimal places." 13194139535687 true] [17592186361239 1000 #edb/ref 17592186361240 13194139535687 true] [17592186361239 1000 #edb/ref 17592186361241 13194139535687 true] [17592186361239 1000 #edb/ref 17592186361242 13194139535687 true] [17592186361239 1000 #edb/ref 17592186361243 13194139535687 true] [17592186361239 1000 #edb/ref 17592186361244 13194139535687 true] [17592186361239 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535687 true] [17592186361239 1041 "selection" 13194139535687 true] [17592186361239 1104 #edb/ref 17592186361241 13194139535687 true] [17592186361239 1110 #uuid "76287ec9-04e3-51b5-ad31-0c438a64ec25" 13194139535687 true] [17592186361240 1034 "0.3783" 13194139535687 true] [17592186361240 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535687 true] [17592186361240 1111 #uuid "b4ddc0f0-18ee-5c54-9fed-58526e5513a1" 13194139535687 true] [17592186361241 1034 "0.4960" 13194139535687 true] [17592186361241 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535687 true] [17592186361241 1111 #uuid "cbd877e5-7438-52b6-bd3c-a6a18a96881b" 13194139535687 true] [17592186361242 1034 "0.4520" 13194139535687 true] [17592186361242 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535687 true] [17592186361242 1111 #uuid "3234ee43-c2ad-5bcd-9f7f-e98b14b18be3" 13194139535687 true] [17592186361243 1034 "0.3254" 13194139535687 true] [17592186361243 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535687 true] [17592186361243 1111 #uuid "ddd561ef-5914-5479-ad1c-3dd31cec0a37" 13194139535687 true] [17592186361244 1034 "0.4280" 131941395